  "sale_events": [],
  "body": "THE VENDOR HAS MOVED ON PRICE. NOW IT'S YOUR MOVE!\r\n\r\nBrand-new. Four bedrooms. Fully standalone. Freehold. Double Westlake school zones. And backed by a 10-Year Master Build Guarantee!\r\n\r\n42E Gordon Avenue, Milford delivers the whole package, and the vendor has revised their price expectations. If Milford has been on your wish list, now is the time to act!\r\n\r\nNO BUILDING DELAYS. NO RENOVATIONS. JUST MOVE IN!\r\n\r\n• Title & CCC issued – ready for its new owner!\r\n\r\n• 4 generous bedrooms – including a master ensuite\r\n\r\n• Fully standalone & freehold – your own home, no shared walls\r\n\r\n• Stylish modern kitchen – premium appliances and quality finishes\r\n\r\n• Sun-filled open-plan living – flowing straight onto a private deck\r\n\r\n• Central air conditioning – comfort in every season\r\n\r\n• Double Westlake school zones – a location families compete for\r\n\r\n• Milford Beach & Village – shopping, cafés and coastal lifestyle just minutes away\r\n\r\nTHE LOCATION IS PREMIUM. THE VENDOR IS MOTIVATED. THE OPPORTUNITY IS REAL.\r\n\r\nWhy pay for an ageing Milford home and then spend more renovating when you could move straight into a brand-new one?\r\n\r\nThe vendor is ready to consider offers. Don't sit back watching this one.\r\n\r\nCall today, inspect 42E Gordon Avenue and put your offer on the table!",
